      "writtenOn": "2024-05-07T05:44:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is possible to embed a static key here and use (for example) x509.ParsePKCS8PrivateKey() to parse it into a private key object. The likelihood of such hard coded static key being listed in OpenSSH\u0027s authorized_keys is close to zero, as it is for a random key. The only benefit of a static key would be that the unit test would run slightly faster due to eliminated key generation step.\n\nWould you prefer the static key approach?",
      "parentUuid": "af45195e_34000cdf",
